## Directory Layout

### `{{APP_NAME}}/`

The main project. Contains all application source code.

### `{{APP_NAME}}.Tests/`

xUnit test project.

### `build/`

{{IF_CLIENT_PACKAGING}}
Build scripts and installer configuration.

- `Build.ps1` runs the configuration-file check, format verification (`dotnet format --verify-no-changes`), requirement-coverage check, and tests, then publishes {{APP_NAME}} to `build/{{APP_NAME}}/`. All checks must pass before publish proceeds
- `Menu.bat` is an interactive menu over `Build.ps1` and `Installer.ps1`
- `Installer.ps1` invokes Inno Setup (ISCC.exe) on `Setup_{{APP_NAME}}.iss`; requires `build/{{APP_NAME}}/{{APP_NAME}}.exe` to exist. Before running ISCC it reads `<Version>` from `Directory.Build.props` (`docs/rules/dotnet.md`, VERSION), injects it via `/DMyAppVersion`, and — if `CHANGELOG.md` exists — verifies as its release packaging gate that `CHANGELOG.md` contains a heading for the current version (failing otherwise)
- Output directories: `build/{{APP_NAME}}/` (publish output) and `build/Installer/` (installer package), both gitignored (`docs/rules/dotnet.md`, OUTPUT)
{{END_IF}}
{{IF_NO_CLIENT_PACKAGING}}
Build scripts.

- `Build.ps1` runs the configuration-file check, format verification (`dotnet format --verify-no-changes`), requirement-coverage check, and tests, then publishes {{APP_NAME}} to `build/{{APP_NAME}}/` for the runtime named by `-Runtime` (default `win-x64`). All checks must pass before publish proceeds
- Output directory: `build/{{APP_NAME}}/` (publish output), gitignored (`docs/rules/dotnet.md`, OUTPUT)
{{END_IF}}

### `docs/`

All non-source documents, placed in role-based subfolders (`rules/`, `adr/`, `specs/`,
`guides/`, `references/`, `investigations/`, `notes/`, `plans/`, `inbox/`, `archive/`).
Before creating, changing, moving, renaming, archiving, or deleting any document — or
when unsure where one belongs — read `docs/rules/documentation.md` (also distributed
in this repository) first; it defines placement, naming, and front matter.

- `docs/rules/` — rule bodies: universal shared rules (`docs/rules/standard.md`, `docs/rules/documentation.md`, `docs/rules/specs.md`, `docs/rules/testing.md`), `docs/rules/dotnet.md`, the conditional shared and .NET facet rule files distributed to this repository (all managed by dev-standards), and `docs/rules/{{APP_NAME}}.md` (application rules)
- `docs/specs/{{APP_NAME}}.md` — the {{APP_NAME}} specification: what it does
- `docs/references/code-map.md` — feature folders and shared mechanism homes
- `docs/adr/` — Architecture Decision Records; retired ADRs move to `docs/adr/archive/`
- `docs/plans/` and `docs/archive/plans/` — working area for plans, gitignored (`docs/rules/documentation.md`, Category Notes — `docs/plans/`)
